<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Academy Theme Shortcodes on Exoscale Academy</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/</link><description>Recent content in Academy Theme Shortcodes on Exoscale Academy</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Alert</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/alerts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/alerts/</guid><description>&lt;p>The academy-theme &lt;code>alert&lt;/code> shortcode renders a styled alert box. The &lt;code>type&lt;/code> parameter controls the color and icon.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; alert type=&amp;#34;note&amp;#34; title=&amp;#34;Note&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}}Alert content with **Markdown** support.{{&amp;lt; /alert &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Parameters:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Default&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>type&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>Alert style: &lt;code>note&lt;/code>, &lt;code>info&lt;/code>, &lt;code>danger&lt;/code>, &lt;code>warning&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>&lt;em>(none)&lt;/em>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>title&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>Optional title above the alert body&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>&lt;em>(none)&lt;/em>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Examples:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>











&lt;div class="alert alert-primary" role="alert">
 &lt;h4 class="alert-heading">Note&lt;/h4>
 
 A plain alert with a title.
 
&lt;/div>








&lt;div class="alert alert-custom" style="border-color: #7A848E;" role="alert">
 &lt;h4 class="alert-heading" style="color: #7A848E;">Note&lt;/h4>
 
 This alert supports a title and &lt;strong>Markdown&lt;/strong>.
 
&lt;/div>









&lt;div class="alert alert-custom" style="border-color: #3772ff;" role="alert">
 &lt;h4 class="alert-heading" style="color: #3772ff;">Info&lt;/h4>
 
 This is an informational alert.
 
&lt;/div>









&lt;div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
&lt;h4 class="alert-heading">Danger&lt;/h4>

 This is a danger alert.

&lt;/div>








&lt;div class="alert alert-custom" style="border-color: #EBC017;" role="alert">
 &lt;h4 class="alert-heading" style="color: #EBC017;">Warning&lt;/h4>
 
 This is a warning alert.
 
&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>Details (Collapsible)</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/theme-details/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/theme-details/</guid><description>&lt;p>The academy-theme &lt;code>details&lt;/code> shortcode renders a collapsible content block.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; details summary=&amp;#34;Click to expand&amp;#34; open=&amp;#34;true&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Collapsed content here. Supports **Markdown**.
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; /details &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Parameters:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Default&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>summary&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>Clickable summary text&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>&lt;em>(empty)&lt;/em>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>open&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>Set to &lt;code>&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;&lt;/code> to start expanded&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>collapsed&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Expanded by default:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>

&lt;details class="details-shortcode" open>
 &lt;summary>
 &lt;strong>Academy theme details (open)&lt;/strong>
 &lt;/summary>
 &lt;div class="details-content">
 &lt;p>This is the academy-theme implementation of the &lt;code>details&lt;/code> shortcode. It starts expanded because &lt;code>open=&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;&lt;/code> is set.&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Supports &lt;strong>Markdown&lt;/strong> formatting&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Lists, &lt;code>code&lt;/code>, and &lt;em>emphasis&lt;/em> all render correctly&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
 &lt;/div>
 &lt;/details>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Collapsed by default:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Pageinfo</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/theme-pageinfo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/theme-pageinfo/</guid><description>&lt;p>The academy-theme &lt;code>pageinfo&lt;/code> shortcode renders a page-level notice box.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; pageinfo &amp;gt;}}Notice content with **Markdown** support.{{&amp;lt; /pageinfo &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Example:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>


&lt;div class="pageinfo">

This block uses the academy-theme implementation of `pageinfo`. It is useful for rendering page-level status notices, such as deprecation warnings or draft indicators.

&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>Chapterstyle</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/chapterstyle/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/chapterstyle/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>chapterstyle&lt;/code> shortcode wraps content in a &lt;code>&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;&lt;/code> with custom inline styles, useful for visually distinguishing chapter or section blocks.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{% chapterstyle style=&amp;#34;padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; border-radius: 0.75rem; background: #f8fafc;&amp;#34; %}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Your styled content here.
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{% /chapterstyle %}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Parameters:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Default&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>style&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>CSS style string applied to the wrapper &lt;code>&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>&lt;em>(none)&lt;/em>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Example:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --></description></item><item><title>SVG</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/svg/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-380/content-formatting-examples/academy-theme/svg/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>svg&lt;/code> shortcode renders an inline SVG icon from &lt;code>assets/icons/{name}.svg&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; svg name=&amp;#34;layer5-academy-icon&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Parameters:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Default&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>name&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>SVG file name (without extension) from &lt;code>assets/icons/&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>&lt;em>(required)&lt;/em>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Example:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The icon renders inline: 

